OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FITV News takes a look at how people
OL,8,Faround the globe are preparing for the
OL,9,Fbig space event.
OL,11,FSpecialist glasses have sold out
OL,12,Facross the UK as Brits scrambled to
OL,13,Fgrab a pair before the eclipse.
OL,15,FThe Royal Greenwich Observatory said
OL,16,Fit had sold approximately 15,000 pairs
OL,17,Fof eclipse glasses in the last month.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FPeople queued for up to three hours in
OL,8,FLondon to get their hands on the
OL,9,Fspecial shades on Tuesday, and a fresh
OL,10,Fdelivery meant there were further last
OL,11,Fminute queues on Wednesday.
OL,13,FSome looking to make extra cash have
OL,14,Fbeen selling the glasses on for #30 a
OL,15,Fpair.
OL,17,FITV News reporter Isla Todd spoke to
OL,18,Fpeople queuing to buy eclipse glasses
OL,19,Fin London and demonstrates how those
OL,20,Fwho missed out can use a colander
OL,21,Finstead
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
