OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FThe Channel Islands is expected to be
OL,8,Fone of the best places to watch the
OL,9,Feclipse, with its peak hitting at
OL,10,F7.17pm.
OL,12,FPeople have already begun gathering on
OL,13,Fthe beach in St Ouen's Bay, Jersey and
OL,14,Fsome bars have even made eclipse
OL,15,Fthemed cocktails for those coming to
OL,16,Fwatch the display.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
