SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FOne man told ITV News he was "really
OL,8,Fexcited" and had brought his whole
OL,9,Ffamily down to see the eclipse and
OL,10,Fhopefully the meteor showers expected
OL,11,Fto follow.
OL,13,FIceland and Spain are both expected to
OL,14,Fsee rare a full eclipse, predicted to
OL,15,Flast a few minutes.
OL,17,FAbout 40 Nasa scientists have arrived
OL,18,Fin Iceland, using planes to study the
OL,19,Feffects of the eclipse on the Earth's
OL,20,Fatmosphere.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
