PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,F"It's really something... it's really
OL,8,Fthat the eclipse is chasing us. We're
OL,9,Fgoing to get the airplane ahead of the
OL,10,Feclipse," said Nasa pilot Tom Parent.
OL,12,FEmergency teams from the Icelandic Red
OL,13,FCross are on site as thousands of
OL,14,Fpeople gather, causing traffic to
OL,15,Fbuild near the Westfjords and the
OL,16,Fcapital Reykjavik.
OL,18,FThere is one slight issue, however, in
OL,19,Fthat the weather is cloudy, but
OL,20,Fhopefully the phenomenon will still be
OL,21,Fvisible.
