OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FAsta Sigurbjorg Gudjonsdottir, a 97-
OL,8,Fyear-old from Iceland, remembers the
OL,9,F1954 solar eclipse.
OL,11,FAged 25 at the time, she said: "The
OL,12,Fmoon gradually came over the sun, the
OL,13,Fbirds were chirping a lot. Then it got
OL,14,Fcolder."
OL,16,F"I took my baby out of the stroller
OL,17,Fand ran to my mum, who lived next
OL,18,Fdoor," Ms Sigurbjorg Gudjonsdottir
OL,19,Frecalled.
