OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,F"I thought it was terrifying. I
OL,8,Fthought it was the greatest sight I
OL,9,Fhad ever seen," she added.
OL,11,FMs Sigurbjorg Gudjonsdottir said she
OL,12,Fis looking forward to Wednesday's
OL,13,Feclipse and plans to watch it at home
OL,14,Fwith her friend.
OL,16,FRecord numbers of hotels have been
OL,17,Fbooked across Spain ahead of the
OL,18,Feclipse.
OL,26,@sD@KxwsD@QoysD@SrwsD@Wrw
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
