OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FPublic transport has been ramped up in
OL,8,FMadrid and five cruise ships carrying
OL,9,Fthousands of tourists arrived in A
OL,10,FCoruna port on Wednesday.
OL,12,FOne British couple from Chester said
OL,13,Fthey had travelled to Spain just for
OL,14,Fthe eclipse.
OL,16,FThey said: "It's a lifetime
OL,17,Fopportunity. We've come on a cruise
OL,18,Fship, and what better place there is
OL,19,Fto see it?"
OL,26,@rD@ETw
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
