OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FAround 5,000 people are expected to
OL,8,Farrive at a viewing hill in Paredes de
OL,9,FNava, in Palencia and in Oviedo,
OL,10,Fnorthern Spain, all the hotels in
OL,11,FOviedo, northern Spain are fully
OL,12,Fbooked, with prices doubling.
OL,14,FLong queues for special glasses to see
OL,15,Fthe eclipse have also been forming
OL,16,Facross Catalonia.
OL,18,FNasa scientists have gathered in the
OL,19,Fsmall Spanish village of Villalibado
OL,20,Fin the province of Burgos to study the
OL,21,Fevent.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
