OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FEclipse chasers Talaat Qureshi and
OL,13,FKryss Katsiavriades have arrived in
OL,14,FMallorca to watch the phenomenon.
OL,16,F"There's already excitement built up.
OL,17,FIt's absolutely buzzing," Ms Qureshi
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,20,FMr Katsiavriades recalled seeing his
OL,21,Ffavourite eclipse in Venezuela in 1998.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
