FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FHe described how everything "went
OL,8,Fquiet and the sky was turning a deep
OL,9,Fdark maroon colour and the sea turned
OL,10,Fgreen".
OL,12,F"In the distance we could see the
OL,13,Fdarkness of the moon's shadow
OL,14,Fapproaching like a storm," he
OL,15,Fcontinued.
OL,17,F"Then during totality we could see
OL,18,Fthree planets at the same time as the
OL,19,Feclipsed Sun."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
