OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786630729
OL,3,CExcitement builds as skygazers prepare
OL,4,Cto witness best solar eclipse since
OL,5,C1999
OL,7,FMs Qureshi said the Sun turned golden
OL,8,F"like Tinkerbell", adding: "It's
OL,9,Fnature at its most spectacular."
OL,11,FThousands have also gathered in
OL,12,FPortugal where the eclipse is expected
OL,13,Fto last a mere 26 seconds.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
